    "name": "file-type",
    "title": "File Type",
    "description": "Colour-coded file-type icons (PDF, DOCX, XLSX, MP4, ZIP and more) in outline, solid, light and mono variants, resolved from extension, file name or MIME type.",
    "category": "file-upload",
